  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    out_grid = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] == 1:\n                for W in range(3, min(rows - r, cols - c) + 1):\n                    top_edge = all(grid[r][c + i] == 1 for i in range(W))\n                    if not top_edge:\n                        break\n                    \n                    bottom_edge = all(grid[r + W - 1][c + i] == 1 for i in range(W))\n                    if not bottom_edge:\n                        continue\n                        \n                    left_edge = all(grid[r + i][c] == 1 for i in range(W))\n                    if not left_edge:\n                        continue\n                        \n                    right_edge = all(grid[r + i][c + W - 1] == 1 for i in range(W))\n                    if not right_edge:\n                        continue\n                        \n                    interior_empty = True\n                    for i in range(1, W - 1):\n                        for j in range(1, W - 1):\n                            if grid[r + i][c + j] != 0:\n                                interior_empty = False\n                                break\n                        if not interior_empty:\n                            break\n                            \n                    if interior_empty:\n                        fill_val = 2 if W % 2 == 0 else 7\n                        for i in range(1, W - 1):\n                            for j in range(1, W - 1):\n                                out_grid[r + i][c + j] = fill_val\n    return out_grid\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    out_grid = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] == 1:\n                for W in range(3, min(rows - r, cols - c) + 1):\n                    top_edge = all(grid[r][c + i] == 1 for i in range(W))\n                    if not top_edge:\n                        break\n                    \n                    bottom_edge = all(grid[r + W - 1][c + i] == 1 for i in range(W))\n                    if not bottom_edge:\n                        continue\n                        \n                    left_edge = all(grid[r + i][c] == 1 for i in range(W))\n                    if not left_edge:\n                        continue\n                        \n                    right_edge = all(grid[r + i][c + W - 1] == 1 for i in range(W))\n                    if not right_edge:\n                        continue\n                        \n                    interior_empty = True\n                    for i in range(1, W - 1):\n                        for j in range(1, W - 1):\n                            if grid[r + i][c + j] != 0:\n                                interior_empty = False\n                                break\n                        if not interior_empty:\n                            break\n                            \n                    if interior_empty:\n                        fill_val = 2 if W % 2 == 0 else 7\n                        for i in range(1, W - 1):\n                            for j in range(1, W - 1):\n                                out_grid[r + i][c + j] = fill_val\n    return out_grid",
